  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0107_e3803ba6312c.png\" style=\"width: 553px; height: 148px;\" /></p><p>In first step nitration of benzene ring will take place at para position, since ethyl group is ortho-para directing in nature.&nbsp;</p><p>Then halogenation&nbsp;reaction will take place at benzyl position followed by dehydrohalogenation&nbsp;reaction with alcoholic KOH.</p>"
